n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['tables/budgets.tex', 'derived/allocations.csv']\n100 ('openllm', 1870, 'borda', 0.5): promotion is unattainable, independently certified; no finite budget or zero-cost intervention is inferred.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['tables/budgets.tex', 'derived/allocations.csv']\n101 HELM row 10 reverses mean/median ordering from 9/12 at full cap to 23/12 at half cap. Open LLM row 1609 reverses from 2/3 to 4/3. These are instance counterexamples, not population rates.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['derived/original_records.json', 'figures/paired_mean_median_budgets.pdf']\n102 All eight original targets per family are reachable under all rules at full cap. At half cap HELM reachability is 5/5/4 and Open LLM is 7/6/3 for mean/median/Borda.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['derived/summary.json', 'figures/cap_conditioned_reachability.pdf']\n103 Every original reference interval closes, all finite selected cardinalities match reference minima, and selected subsets repeat identically across three seeds.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['scripts/build_results.py', 'derived/summary.json']\n104 Matched greedy equals the finite minimum for original mean and Borda decisions. HELM row28 median at half cap has optimum21 versus greedy52. No component attribution follows.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['derived/summary.json', 'derived/original_records.json']\n105 Permutation, constant and zero-update controls each have 48 validated decisions per family and seed with no case failure; one first-seed replay is recorded as successful and the remaining replay payloads are absent.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['derived/summary.json']\n106 Mean sorted gains, odd-median threshold counting, even-median endpoint counting and rival-aware Borda integer gap constraints describe the inspectable supplied selected source; its tree-digest scope is not equated to the final manifest. Borda search has 20000-node limit, 0.9 work allowance and verified incumbent fallback. Exhaustive scalar verification is used when d<=6.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:63', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:73', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:82', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:93', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:160', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:193', 'source_evidence/downstream/program/src/program.py:268']\n107 Independent references use exhaustive six-task subsets, exact scalar HELM checks, and time-limited SciPy binary Borda optimization; random and greedy are matched score-space selection policies, not training algorithms.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['data/protocol.json', 'source_evidence/evaluation.py', 'source_evidence/downstream/baseline/src/program.py']\n108 Development selection had three scored configurations, zero unscored configurations, and zero aggregate difference from the original baseline; no matched final original-baseline delta is available.\n  ids: ['study.attempts.total', 'study.attempts.scored', 'study.attempts.unscored', 'study.search_score', 'study.baseline_score', 'study.search_score_delta', 'study.investigation_outcome', 'study.selection_kind'] artifacts: []\n109 The independent frozen final assessment is completed and qualified; this does not establish generalization, novelty or superiority.\n  ids: ['final.qualification.status', 'final.qualification.outcome', 'final.qualification.correct'] artifacts: []\n110 No ablation supports internal component superiority; training-response calibration, strict-margin sensitivity and composition resampling are unavailable. Task budgets are not observed training cost.\n  ids: ['final.evidence.episodes'] artifacts: ['source_evidence/downstream/program/src/METHOD.md', 'data/protocol.json']\n11